    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81584" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικράνιος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>round the skull</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῖλος
